# Code owners for Homebase.
#
# The code owner is automatically requested for review on every pull request.
# Homebase is a single-maintainer public repo, so one owner owns all paths.
#
# This pairs with branch protection on `main`: enabling "Require review from Code
# Owners" turns this from a request into a hard requirement (the owner's approval is
# needed to merge). Until then, it just auto-requests the owner as a reviewer.
#
# Later, more specific rules can be added below the catch-all (last match wins), e.g.
#   /infra/    @ryfranklin
#   /services/ @ryfranklin

* @ryfranklin
